{
  "name": "perfectys",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.4.0-dev",
  "description": "Perfectys Compta \u2014 comptabilit\u00e9 g\u00e9n\u00e9rale SYSCOHADA r\u00e9vis\u00e9 sur le mod\u00e8le Sage, paquet pays B\u00e9nin (noyau TypeScript, interface web, h\u00f4te Windows \u00e0 venir)",
